    "terms.updated": "Last updated: 23 September 2026 · Provided in English only.",
    "terms.intro": "By creating an account or using Nakshatra, you agree to these terms.",
    "terms.h1": "1. Entertainment purposes only",
    "terms.p1": "Nakshatra provides astrology, palmistry, and related content for entertainment and self-reflection. It is not professional advice of any kind — medical, legal, financial, or psychological — and should not be used as a substitute for it. Sun, Moon, and Ascendant placements are computed from real astronomical data using the traditional Vedic (sidereal, Lahiri ayanamsa) system; the interpretive text is generated from fixed content rules, not written by a human astrologer or an AI.",
