    "terms.p4": "The \"chat with an astrologer\" feature is simulated: replies are selected from pre-written, rule-based responses. They are not generated by a real person or by an AI system, and are not written specifically for you.",
    "terms.h5": "5. Purchases and gifting",
    "terms.p5_html": "Where a report tier requires payment, pricing is shown to you at checkout before you pay. Reports unlock immediately after a successful payment, so once a tier has unlocked we generally don't offer a refund — you've already received what you paid for. We will refund you in full if: Razorpay deducted payment but your report or tier never unlocked because of a technical error on our end; you were charged more than once for the same purchase; or your account was compromised and someone else made the purchase without your permission. To request a refund, email <a href=\"mailto:support@nakshatra.ind.in\">support@nakshatra.ind.in</a> within 7 days of the charge with the email address on your account and your Razorpay payment ID. See our full <a href=\"refund-policy.html\" data-i18n=\"footer.refund\">Refund Policy</a> for details. This doesn't limit any refund right you have under Indian consumer protection law. Gift codes you send can be redeemed once by their recipient, and cannot be redeemed by the account that sent them.",
    "terms.h6": "6. Community content",
    "terms.p6": "Posts and captions you share to the community feed are visible to other signed-in users. Don't share anything there you wouldn't want other users to see, and don't post anyone else's personal information without their consent.",
    "terms.h7": "7. Intellectual property",
    "terms.p7": "The app's design, calculations, and content rules belong to us. You keep ownership of what you personally write, such as chat messages or captions — but by posting to the community feed, you allow other users to view it within the app.",
